        ],
        "IdentityIds": null,
        "IsFemale": null,
        "IsClanLeader": null,
        "SkillMin": null
      },
      "Content": "守夜人中仍有人怀疑，却有游骑兵见过尸体睁眼。对黑衣兄弟而言，最危险的不是不知道敌人有多少，而是南方诸侯仍把长城只当流放罪犯的地方。"
    },
    {
      "Priority": 0,
      "When": {
        "HeroIds": null,
        "Cultures": null,
        "KingdomIds": null,
        "SettlementIds": null,
        "Roles": [
          "scholar",
